{"type":"message","id":"8ab04592","parentId":"f80fe2e8","timestamp":"2026-02-25T22:00:57.566Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! I got weather data from Open-Meteo. Let me decode the weathercode:\n- weathercode 1 = Clear sky (https://open-meteo.com/en/docs)\n- Temperature: -0.4°C\n- Wind speed: 4.7 km/h\n- Wind direction: 58° (Northeast)\n- is_day: 0 (it's nighttime, which makes sense for 7 AM in winter)\n\nNow let me compile the morning briefing. I need to:\n1. Current weather in Seoul\n2. Brief system status overview\n3. Any urgent notifications or tasks from memory\n\nFrom MEMORY.md, I can see recent context:\n- OpenClaw Antigravity ban issues (Google API)\n- tavily-search security audit findings (false positives)\n- Daily morning briefing is active\n- Notion daily briefing job exists but had errors and is currently disabled\n- Update available for OpenClaw (npm 2026.2.24)\n\nFor urgent tasks, I should look at what's actionable:\n1. Security warnings (2 warnings in the security audit)\n2. Notion daily briefing job is disabled and needs fixing if Sam wants it\n3. OpenClaw update available\n\nLet me format this as a sharp, helpful morning briefing.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"# 🦉 Hugin의 아침 브리핑\n\n**2026년 2월 26일 (목) 오전 7시** — 서울\n\n---\n\n## 🌤️ 현재 날씨\n\n**서울:** 맑음 ⛅\n- 기온: -0.4°C\n- 체감: 추위 (야간 기준)\n- 바람: 북동풍 4.7 km/h\n- 습도: 데이터 미제공\n\n---\n\n## 🖥️ 시스템 상태\n\n### OpenClaw Gateway\n- ✅ 상태: Healthy (PID 246, active)\n- ✅ 연결: Local reachable (17ms latency)\n- ✅ 채널: Telegram OK\n- ✅ 메모리: Plugin enabled (claude-mem)\n- ✅ 세션: 18개 활성 (main: 137k/205k tokens)\n\n### Security Audit\n- ⚠️ **Warning 2건:**\n  - Reverse proxy 헤더 미신뢰 설정 (loopback only)\n  - Extension plugin tool 접근성 (permissive policy)\n- 📋 Full report: `openclaw security audit`\n\n### 업데이트\n- 📦 **Update available:** npm 2026.2.24 → `openclaw update`\n\n---\n\n## 📋 긴급 사항\n\n### 1. Notion Daily Briefing 장애\n- **상태:** DISABLED + Last run ERROR (~102s timeout)\n- **원인:** Job 실행 중 오류 발생, 배달 상태 unknown\n- **영향:** 아침 Notion 작업 요약이 전송되지 않음\n- **대응:** Job 재활성화 및 에러 원인 조사 필요\n\n### 2. tavily-search Security Audit\n- **상태:** False positive 확인됨\n- **진행:** Cron job 제외 설정 및 .env auto-load 지원 검토 중\n\n### 3. OpenClaw 업데이트 대기\n- **버전:** 2026.2.24 npm update available\n- **조치:** `openclaw update` 실행 권장\n\n---\n\n## 💡 오늘의 요약\n\n시스템은 전반적으로 안정적이나, Notion Daily Briefing 서비스가 비활성화되어 있어 작업 요약을 받지 못하고 있습니다. Security warning은 중요하지만 즉각적인 조치가 필요한 수준은 아닙니다.\n\n**즉시 조치 필요:**\n- Notion daily briefing job 재활성화 여부 결정\n\n**예방 조치:**\n- OpenClaw 업데이트 (보안/버그 픽스 포함)\n\n---\n\n조용한 하루가 되길. 필요한 것이 있으면 말해줘. 🦉"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":151,"output":1169,"cacheRead":24928,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26248,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772056847471}}
